  {
   "id": "floor-9-316478@post-2024-09-17",
   "gameId": "floor-9-316478",
   "displayName": "Bug Fixes and General Information",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "inferred",
   "announcedAt": "2024-09-17T20:29:42.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hello everyone,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "First of all, we want to thank you for your interest in and for playing our game!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We’d like to inform you about the changes and fixes made last week based on your feedback and the bugs reported.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "New Features",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "We’ve added the mouse sensitivity setting to the game, a feature that should have been available from the start. This was implemented based on widespread community requests.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "new",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "RNG and Anomaly Counter Topic",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "One of the most discussed topics was the anomaly counter and RNG system. After reviewing your feedback, we’ve decided that the challenge of seeing all anomalies should remain part of the game’s difficulty. Many other games in this genre also rely heavily on rng, and we believe this system is integral to the experience.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Bug Fixes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "In the first week, achievements were not unlocking even after spotting all the anomalies. This issue has been resolved thanks to your reports.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "We’ve received ongoing feedback regarding the \"Falling Paint\" anomaly still causing issues in certain situations. As a temporary measure, we are removing this anomaly from the game until we can fully fix the problem.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Thank you again for your continued support and feedback. Stay tuned for future updates!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
